    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCAV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the towering Citadel, where the elite thrive, humanity\u2019s remnants scavenge the toxic wastelands, surviving on discarded scraps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a scavenger, you pilot your ship through the corrosive haze, risking everything to salvage resources from the trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your ship, sort and filter out the trash leaving you with precious resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442110/extras/430b82eba98c06feb1a36e288ea9ecc1.poster.avif?t=1750483517\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442110/extras/430b82eba98c06feb1a36e288ea9ecc1.webm?t=1750483517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442110/extras/430b82eba98c06feb1a36e288ea9ecc1.mp4?t=1750483517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using those resources, upgrade your ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442110/extras/1216a31e17baffd9ed1d2aeb419a28c7.poster.avif?t=1750483517\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442110/extras/1216a31e17baffd9ed1d2aeb419a28c7.webm?t=1750483517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442110/extras/1216a31e17baffd9ed1d2aeb419a28c7.mp4?t=1750483517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cl